<title>USA: Wackenhut says Australian operations face 1997 losses.</title>
<headline>Wackenhut says Australian operations face 1997 losses.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Fla. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Wackenhut Corp said Tuesday that while its international operations showed an increase in revenue and profit for the first quarter, its Australian securities services component is not expected to be profitable this year.</p>
<p>The company said Wackenhut International reported a $3.3 million increase in revenue to $28.7 million while operating income was $110,000.</p>
<p>The company said there were substantial increases in both sales and income in Central and South America but losses in Australia negated the profit gains.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
